From f478ced4bb1beded88556b26f31f2acc5a9c0b3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:27:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Movie night lineup: Tonight's poster bookmark and one muted
 "whose" line (rule 1850)

Owner-approved, the simplest version of mockups/journeys/b78-movienight-bookmark.png.
- Lineup cards carry Tonight's bookmark in the poster's top-right corner (web
  tnp-alt-saved + BookmarkIcon; iPhone TonightSaved.badge()).
- One muted line under the title/genre: "On your watchlist", "On Sam's watchlist",
  "On yours and Sam's", "On yours and 2 others'", "On Sam's and 2 others'"
  (savedByLine, mirrored by RoomWords.savedByLine). A guest never reads "your".
- No faces, no blue; the chip row keeps only mood chips.
- The ticket's dead "On your watchlist" tag is gone (web roomLaneTag, iPhone MoodTag).
- Rule 1850 in check-invariants and INVARIANTS.md; rules 128 and 880 amended.

[ds-log: n/a no data science files changed]

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
